# .npmrc is deliberately NOT ignored: it carries this repo's pnpm settings,
# including the auto-install-peers=false divergence the unpublished
# @mj-biz-apps/accounting-ng peer requires. bizapps-accounting and bizapps-orders
# both track theirs; ignoring it here would let CI install with pnpm defaults
# and diverge from local.

